DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/field_extractors/{extractor}
Deletes all custom extraction rules for an extractor type.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; extractor (path) — Extractor type.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/field_extractors/{extractor}
Retrieves the custom extraction rules configured for a given extractor type.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; extractor (path) — Extractor type.
